# ts-core

Shared TypeScript library ([ADR 0016](docs/decisions/0016-ts-core.md)). Isomorphic export: types, board, legal moves, featurizer. Node export `ts-core/match`: MET, MWC, cube formula.

- Specs: `docs/domain/board-representation.md`, `docs/domain/features.md`, `docs/domain/match-play.md`.
- Golden feature vectors: `training-ground/fixtures/features.json`.
- Do not add SGF, bgweb-api, dump CLI, or HTTP here.
- Docker only, from `ts-core/`: `npm test`, `npm run install:host`. Do not run `test:inner` on the host.
